  },
  "contents": [
    {
      "audioPlayer": {
        "sticky": false,
        "src": "/assets/audio/specific-purposes/business/sbelaa/lesson-23.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 23 • Requesting A Bank Loan",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Ivan meets with Gina, a loan officer at L&S Bank, about getting a loan to start a new coffee shop. When Gina reviews his financial forecasts and suggests some changes, Ivan is angry at first but then decides to go along with it."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm here to see about getting a $100,000 loan to start a Coffee Shack franchise."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your application that you've already got two franchise businesses "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "under your belt"
                },
                {
                  "text": " - both Subway sandwich shops. That's certainly "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "nothing to sneeze at"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thank you. Now that I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "know the franchise business inside and out"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", I'd like to expand."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, Subway is a sandwich shop. Now you're talking about a coffee house. That's an entirely "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "different animal"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Sure, there may be a thing or two to learn, but it should be more or less a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "no-brainer"
                },
                {
                  "text": ","
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your business plan that you're basing all of your profit estimates on the profits you made from one of your Subway shops. I don't think that's right. You're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "comparing apples to oranges"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Apples? Oranges? I didn't know we were talking about fruit now. Maybe I should open up a fruit smoothie shop instead!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Ha ha. Well, at least you haven't lost your sense of humor!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, seriously, what do you want me to do?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Go "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "back to the drawing board"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Make some new calculations based on selling coffee, not sandwiches. Then the loan will be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "in the bag"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "If you're going to make me "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "jump through hoops"
                },
                {
                  "text": " to get this loan, I'll just have to take my business to a different bank."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "You're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "missing the point"
                },
                {
                  "text": " here. I'm not trying to make your life difficult. I'm just suggesting you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "beef up"
                },
                {
                  "text": " your business plan so my boss will approve your loan."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, in that case, maybe I will "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "go back to the drawing board"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "textColor": "black",
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Idioms & Expressions"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/c9POdfpqURQ?rel=0"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "(to get or to have) under one’s belt"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to have or to get experience"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: Before you start your own coffee shop, you should work at Starbucks to get some experience under your belt."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/R2IL7-cy99w?rel=0"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "nothing to sneeze at"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "not insignificant; impressive"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: This year, our company opened 15 new sales offices overseas. That's nothing to sneeze at!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/LW3dESjjBDg?rel=0"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "know something inside and out"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to know something very well"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: If you're having a problem with your presentation, ask Pam for help. She knows Power Point inside and out."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "(a) different animal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "something entirely different"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: The Gap had many years of experience selling clothing through retail stores. When they started the Gap.com, they found out that selling online was a different animal."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "no brainer"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "an easy decision; an obvious choice"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: Most of our clients are based in Korea, so it's a no-brainer to open an office there."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "(to) compare apples to oranges"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to compare two unlike things; to make an invalid comparison"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: Comparing a night at EconoLodge with a night at the Four Seasons is like comparing apples to oranges. One is a budget motel, and the other is a luxury hotel."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "to go back to the drawing board"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to start a task over because the last try failed; to start again from the beginning"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: We didn't like the print advertisement our ad agency designed, so we asked them to go back to the drawing board."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "in the bag"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "a sure thing"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: Boeing executives thought that the new military contract was in the bag and were surprised when it was awarded to Airbus instead."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/zfAgyT4hy8Q?start=623"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "(to) jump through hoops"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to go through a lot of difficult work for something; to face many bureaucratic obstacles"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: We had to jump through hoops to get our visas to Russia, but finaly got them."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "(to) miss the point"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to not understand"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: You're missing the point. Your son wants an expensive new cell phone so he can impress his friends, not because he actually needs all of those bells and whistles."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "videoPlayer": [
            {
              "position": "bottom",
              "src": ""
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "beef up"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "to improve; to add to"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Example: When customers started to complain, Facebook beefed up its security features."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
